# Generated site output is written by tools/seo/*.py with explicit newline
# handling (newline='' on read/write). core.autocrlf=true was rewriting line
# endings on every checkout/re-run with no semantic change, showing 19 files
# as modified. Disable git's text-attribute line-ending conversion for the
# generated file types so re-running the generators leaves a clean tree.
*.html -text
*.css -text
*.js -text
